      "message": "To clarify the expectation a little here:\n\nNotify the framework that the command associated with this callback has failed.\n\u003cp\u003e\nMust only be called when there was an error generating a SUBSCRIBE request due to an IMS stack error. This is a terminating event, so no other callback event will be expected after this callback.",
